      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.6",
      "values:originalText": "Each Act that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or\nrepealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule\nconcerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect\naccording to its terms.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\n\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband Network\nMeasures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011          3\nNote:\nOn 1 January 2011, the short title of the Trade Practices Act 1974 was\nchanged to the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 by the Trade\nPractices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "skos:definition": "Each Act that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or\nrepealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule\nconcerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect\naccording to its terms.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\n\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband Network\nMeasures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011          3\nNote:\nOn 1 January 2011, the short title of the Trade Practices Act 1974 was\nchanged to the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 by the Trade\nPractices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 2) 2010.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-3-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-3-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
