    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-62d",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "62D Condition of carrier licence set out in section 152CJC of the",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-62d"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2012c00870.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "Competition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nA carrier licence held by an NBN corporation is subject to the\ncondition set out in section 152CJC of the Competition and\nConsumer Act 2010.\nNote:\nSection 152CJC of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 deals\nwith rules about the supply of services by NBN corporations.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nGeneral amendments  Part 1\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband Network\nMeasures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011          5",
      "skos:definition": "Competition and Consumer Act 2010\n\nA carrier licence held by an NBN corporation is subject to the\ncondition set out in section 152CJC of the Competition and\nConsumer Act 2010.\nNote:\nSection 152CJC of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 deals\nwith rules about the supply of services by NBN corporations.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nGeneral amendments  Part 1\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband Network\nMeasures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011          5",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-62d-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-62d-logic-deontic-1"
        },
