    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-62e",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "62E Condition of carrier licence set out in section 37 of the National",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-62e"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2012c00870.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.9",
      "values:originalText": "Broadband Network Companies Act 2011\n\nA carrier licence held by an NBN corporation is subject to the\ncondition set out in section 37 of the National Broadband Network\nCompanies Act 2011.\nNote:\nSection 37 of the National Broadband Network Companies Act 2011\ndeals with rules about:\n(a) the supply of goods and services by NBN corporations; and\n(b) the investment of money by NBN corporations; and\n(c) the functional separation of NBN corporations; and\n(d) the divestment of assets by NBN corporations.",
      "skos:definition": "Broadband Network Companies Act 2011\n\nA carrier licence held by an NBN corporation is subject to the\ncondition set out in section 37 of the National Broadband Network\nCompanies Act 2011.\nNote:\nSection 37 of the National Broadband Network Companies Act 2011\ndeals with rules about:\n(a) the supply of goods and services by NBN corporations; and\n(b) the investment of money by NBN corporations; and\n(c) the functional separation of NBN corporations; and\n(d) the divestment of assets by NBN corporations.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-62e-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-62e-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0138b13123fb154d3e9e8da2e1705b7098511f428d194b8ce0c5d9a8a971681c",
      "skos:note": "Carrier licence is subject to the condition set out in section 37 of the National Broadband Network Companies Act 2011."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-62e",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "62E Condition of carrier licence set out in section 37 of the National",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 9,
      "values:originalText": "Broadband Network Companies Act 2011\n\nA carrier licence held by an NBN corporation is subject to the\ncondition set out in section 37 of the National Broadband Network\nCompanies Act 2011.\nNote:\nSection 37 of the National Broadband Network Companies Act 2011\ndeals with rules about:\n(a) the supply of goods and services by NBN corporations; and\n(b) the investment of money by NBN corporations; and\n(c) the functional separation of NBN corporations; and\n(d) the divestment of assets by NBN corporations."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-62e-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-62e"
