    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-6-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-6-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2012c00870.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.10",
      "values:originalText": "Network Measures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011\n\n(4E) Subsection (1) does not apply to the condition set out in section 37\nof the National Broadband Network Companies Act 2011.\nNote:\nSection 37 of the National Broadband Network Companies Act 2011\ndeals with rules about:\n(a) the supply of goods and services by NBN corporations; and\n(b) the investment of money by NBN corporations; and\n(c) the functional separation of NBN corporations; and\n(d) the divestment of assets by NBN corporations.\n\n(4F) Subsection (1) does not apply to a condition covered by section 41\nof the National Broadband Network Companies Act 2011.\nNote:\nSection 41 of the National Broadband Network Companies Act 2011\ndeals with rules about the supply of services by NBN corporations.",
      "skos:definition": "Network Measures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011\n\n(4E) Subsection (1) does not apply to the condition set out in section 37\nof the National Broadband Network Companies Act 2011.\nNote:\nSection 37 of the National Broadband Network Companies Act 2011\ndeals with rules about:\n(a) the supply of goods and services by NBN corporations; and\n(b) the investment of money by NBN corporations; and\n(c) the functional separation of NBN corporations; and\n(d) the divestment of assets by NBN corporations.\n\n(4F) Subsection (1) does not apply to a condition covered by section 41\nof the National Broadband Network Companies Act 2011.\nNote:\nSection 41 of the National Broadband Network Companies Act 2011\ndeals with rules about the supply of services by NBN corporations.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-6-2-ss-4e"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-6-2-ss-4f"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "bc806b2c26ce22cd25c65c81147bd806a1f45bd04468bfcf1248ff1791822f94"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-6-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 10,
      "values:originalText": "Network Measures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011\n\n(4E) Subsection (1) does not apply to the condition set out in section 37\nof the National Broadband Network Companies Act 2011.\nNote:\nSection 37 of the National Broadband Network Companies Act 2011\ndeals with rules about:\n(a) the supply of goods and services by NBN corporations; and\n(b) the investment of money by NBN corporations; and\n(c) the functional separation of NBN corporations; and\n(d) the divestment of assets by NBN corporations.\n\n(4F) Subsection (1) does not apply to a condition covered by section 41\nof the National Broadband Network Companies Act 2011.\nNote:\nSection 41 of the National Broadband Network Companies Act 2011\ndeals with rules about the supply of services by NBN corporations."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-6-2-ss-4e",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6(4E) Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband",
