      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6(4E) Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 10,
      "values:originalText": "(4E) Subsection (1) does not apply to the condition set out in section 37\nof the National Broadband Network Companies Act 2011.\nNote:\nSection 37 of the National Broadband Network Companies Act 2011\ndeals with rules about:\n(a) the supply of goods and services by NBN corporations; and\n(b) the investment of money by NBN corporations; and\n(c) the functional separation of NBN corporations; and\n(d) the divestment of assets by NBN corporations."
    },
