      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.10",
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n\n; (g) the condition set out in section 152CJC of the Competition\nand Consumer Act 2010;\n\n(h) the condition set out in section 37 of the National Broadband\nNetwork Companies Act 2011;\n\n(i) a condition covered by section 41 of the National Broadband\nNetwork Companies Act 2011.",
      "skos:definition": "Add:\n\n; (g) the condition set out in section 152CJC of the Competition\nand Consumer Act 2010;\n\n(h) the condition set out in section 37 of the National Broadband\nNetwork Companies Act 2011;\n\n(i) a condition covered by section 41 of the National Broadband\nNetwork Companies Act 2011.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-7-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9589137f9539ec210f8ea9cc0575327100164a3bf89b758d91391a7bedbde28f",
      "skos:note": "Adds conditions from other acts"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "7 At the end of subsection 70(5)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 10,
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n\n; (g) the condition set out in section 152CJC of the Competition\nand Consumer Act 2010;\n\n(h) the condition set out in section 37 of the National Broadband\nNetwork Companies Act 2011;\n\n(i) a condition covered by section 41 of the National Broadband\nNetwork Companies Act 2011."
    },
