    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-14",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "14 At the end of section 115",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-14"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2012c00870.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.12",
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n\n(5) The rule in subsection (1) does not apply to an industry code or an\nindustry standard to the extent (if any) to which compliance with\nthe code or standard is likely to have the effect (whether direct or\nindirect) of requiring:\n\n(a) optical fibre lines; or\n\n(b) facilities used, or for use, in or in connection with optical\nfibre lines;\nto:\n\n(c) have particular design features; or\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nGeneral amendments  Part 1\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband Network\nMeasures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011          9\n\n(d) meet particular performance requirements.",
      "skos:definition": "Add:\n\n(5) The rule in subsection (1) does not apply to an industry code or an\nindustry standard to the extent (if any) to which compliance with\nthe code or standard is likely to have the effect (whether direct or\nindirect) of requiring:\n\n(a) optical fibre lines; or\n\n(b) facilities used, or for use, in or in connection with optical\nfibre lines;\nto:\n\n(c) have particular design features; or\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nGeneral amendments  Part 1\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband Network\nMeasures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011          9\n\n(d) meet particular performance requirements.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-14-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-14-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "389208251651c3de4b5e469fc5b54f4fd89e668b130ace44dafbc0b2b3014080",
      "skos:note": "Exemptions for industry codes and standards"
    },
    {
