    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-19",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "19 At the end of subsection 564(3) (after the notes)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-19"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2012c00870.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.14",
      "values:originalText": "Add:\nNote 11:\nSection 152CJC of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 deals\nwith rules about the supply of services by NBN corporations.\nNote 12:\nSubsection 152CJD(2) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010\ndeals with rules about the supply of services by NBN corporations.\nNote 13:\nSection 37 of the National Broadband Network Companies Act 2011\ndeals with rules about:\n(a) the supply of goods and services by NBN corporations; and\n(b) the investment of money by NBN corporations; and\n(c) the functional separation of NBN corporations; and\n(d) the divestment of assets by NBN corporations.\nNote 14:\nSubsection 38(2) of the National Broadband Network Companies Act\n2011 deals with rules about:\n(a) the supply of goods and services by NBN corporations; and\n(b) the investment of money by NBN corporations; and\n(c) the functional separation of NBN corporations; and\n(d) the divestment of assets by NBN corporations.\nNote 15:\nSection 41 of the National Broadband Network Companies Act 2011\ndeals with rules about the supply of services by NBN corporations.",
      "skos:definition": "Add:\nNote 11:\nSection 152CJC of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 deals\nwith rules about the supply of services by NBN corporations.\nNote 12:\nSubsection 152CJD(2) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010\ndeals with rules about the supply of services by NBN corporations.\nNote 13:\nSection 37 of the National Broadband Network Companies Act 2011\ndeals with rules about:\n(a) the supply of goods and services by NBN corporations; and\n(b) the investment of money by NBN corporations; and\n(c) the functional separation of NBN corporations; and\n(d) the divestment of assets by NBN corporations.\nNote 14:\nSubsection 38(2) of the National Broadband Network Companies Act\n2011 deals with rules about:\n(a) the supply of goods and services by NBN corporations; and\n(b) the investment of money by NBN corporations; and\n(c) the functional separation of NBN corporations; and\n(d) the divestment of assets by NBN corporations.\nNote 15:\nSection 41 of the National Broadband Network Companies Act 2011\ndeals with rules about the supply of services by NBN corporations.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-19-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "63ffbd77cd2e7bec10ddd10e89b7332207999fd7c0c19a1763e66ede3a67a36f",
      "skos:note": "References relevant sections of other acts dealing with NBN corporations"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-19",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "19 At the end of subsection 564(3) (after the notes)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 14,
      "values:originalText": "Add:\nNote 11:\nSection 152CJC of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 deals\nwith rules about the supply of services by NBN corporations.\nNote 12:\nSubsection 152CJD(2) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010\ndeals with rules about the supply of services by NBN corporations.\nNote 13:\nSection 37 of the National Broadband Network Companies Act 2011\ndeals with rules about:\n(a) the supply of goods and services by NBN corporations; and\n(b) the investment of money by NBN corporations; and\n(c) the functional separation of NBN corporations; and\n(d) the divestment of assets by NBN corporations.\nNote 14:\nSubsection 38(2) of the National Broadband Network Companies Act\n2011 deals with rules about:\n(a) the supply of goods and services by NBN corporations; and\n(b) the investment of money by NBN corporations; and\n(c) the functional separation of NBN corporations; and\n(d) the divestment of assets by NBN corporations.\nNote 15:\nSection 41 of the National Broadband Network Companies Act 2011\ndeals with rules about the supply of services by NBN corporations."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-19-norm",
