    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-24",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "24 Clause 45 of Schedule 1 (definition of active declared",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-24"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2012c00870.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.16",
      "values:originalText": "service)\nRepeal the definition, substitute:\nactive declared service means:\n\n(a) an active declared service within the meaning of\nsection 152AR of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010;\nor\n\n(b) a declared service (within the meaning of subsection\n152AL(8A) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010) that\nan NBN corporation supplies (whether to itself or to other\npersons); or\n\n(c) a declared service within the meaning of subsection\n152AL(8D) or (8E) of the Competition and Consumer Act\n2010.\nNote:\nSubsections 152AL(8A), (8D) and (8E) of the Competition and\nConsumer Act 2010 deal with services supplied by an NBN\ncorporation.\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010",
      "skos:definition": "service)\nRepeal the definition, substitute:\nactive declared service means:\n\n(a) an active declared service within the meaning of\nsection 152AR of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010;\nor\n\n(b) a declared service (within the meaning of subsection\n152AL(8A) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010) that\nan NBN corporation supplies (whether to itself or to other\npersons); or\n\n(c) a declared service within the meaning of subsection\n152AL(8D) or (8E) of the Competition and Consumer Act\n2010.\nNote:\nSubsections 152AL(8A), (8D) and (8E) of the Competition and\nConsumer Act 2010 deal with services supplied by an NBN\ncorporation.\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-24-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "963b8639edfabddb445124d34f8da259e6189406a3a5883c0ea302ca052795b5",
      "skos:note": "Definition of active declared service"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-24",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "24 Clause 45 of Schedule 1 (definition of active declared",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 16,
      "values:originalText": "service)\nRepeal the definition, substitute:\nactive declared service means:\n\n(a) an active declared service within the meaning of\nsection 152AR of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010;\nor\n\n(b) a declared service (within the meaning of subsection\n152AL(8A) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010) that\nan NBN corporation supplies (whether to itself or to other\npersons); or\n\n(c) a declared service within the meaning of subsection\n152AL(8D) or (8E) of the Competition and Consumer Act\n2010.\nNote:\nSubsections 152AL(8A), (8D) and (8E) of the Competition and\nConsumer Act 2010 deal with services supplied by an NBN\ncorporation.\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010"
    },
