    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-151da",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "151DA Authorised conduct—subsection 51(1)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-151da"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2012c00870.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.17",
      "values:originalText": "Objects\n\n(1) The objects of this section are:\n\n(a) to promote the national interest in structural reform of the\ntelecommunications industry; and\n\n(b) to promote uniform national pricing of eligible services\nsupplied by NBN corporations by authorising, for the\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "skos:definition": "Objects\n\n(1) The objects of this section are:\n\n(a) to promote the national interest in structural reform of the\ntelecommunications industry; and\n\n(b) to promote uniform national pricing of eligible services\nsupplied by NBN corporations by authorising, for the\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "cml:asserts": [
