      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.18",
      "values:originalText": "Network Measures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011\npurposes of subsection 51(1), certain conduct engaged in by\nNBN corporations.\nNote 1:\nIf conduct is authorised for the purposes of subsection 51(1), the\nconduct is disregarded in deciding whether a person has contravened",
      "skos:definition": "Network Measures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011\npurposes of subsection 51(1), certain conduct engaged in by\nNBN corporations.\nNote 1:\nIf conduct is authorised for the purposes of subsection 51(1), the\nconduct is disregarded in deciding whether a person has contravened",
