      "cof:pageNumber": 22,
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of this Division, a point of interconnection\nspecified in a list in force under subsection (1) is a listed point of\ninterconnection."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-151db-ss-2-norm",
