    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-151dd",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "151DD Review of operation of this Division",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-151dd"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2012c00870.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.23",
      "values:originalText": "(1) After the end of the 2-year period that began at the commencement\nof this Division, the Minister must cause to be conducted an\nindependent review of the operation of this Division during that\nperiod.\n\n(2) Without limiting subsection (1), a review under that subsection\nmust consider:\n\n(a) the conduct that was authorised under subsection 151DA(2)\nfor the purposes of subsection 51(1); and\n\n(b) the conduct that was authorised under subsection 151DA(3)\nfor the purposes of subsection 51(1); and\n\n(c) the conduct that was authorised under subsection 151DA(4)\nfor the purposes of subsection 51(1).\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "skos:definition": "(1) After the end of the 2-year period that began at the commencement\nof this Division, the Minister must cause to be conducted an\nindependent review of the operation of this Division during that\nperiod.\n\n(2) Without limiting subsection (1), a review under that subsection\nmust consider:\n\n(a) the conduct that was authorised under subsection 151DA(2)\nfor the purposes of subsection 51(1); and\n\n(b) the conduct that was authorised under subsection 151DA(3)\nfor the purposes of subsection 51(1); and\n\n(c) the conduct that was authorised under subsection 151DA(4)\nfor the purposes of subsection 51(1).\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
