    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-30",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "30 Section 152AA",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-30"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2012c00870.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.24",
      "values:originalText": "Omit:\n•\nThe Commission may declare carriage services and related\nservices to be declared services.\nsubstitute:\n•\nA carriage service, or a related service, supplied, or capable\nof being supplied, by a carrier (other than an NBN\ncorporation) or a carriage service provider (other than an\nNBN corporation) is a declared service if:\n\n(a)\nthe Commission has declared the service to be a\ndeclared service; or\n\n(b)\nthe service is supplied by the carrier or carriage\nservice provider, and a special access undertaking\ngiven by the carrier or carriage service provider is\nin operation in relation to the service.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nGeneral amendments  Part 1\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband Network\nMeasures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011          21\n•\nA carriage service, or a related service, supplied, or capable\nof being supplied, by an NBN corporation is a declared\nservice if:\n\n(a)\nthe Commission has declared the service to be a\ndeclared service; or\n\n(b)\nthe NBN corporation has formulated a standard\nform of access agreement that relates to access to\nthe service; or\n\n(c)\nthe service is supplied by the NBN corporation,\nand a special access undertaking given by the NBN\ncorporation is in operation in relation to the\nservice.",
      "skos:definition": "Omit:\n•\nThe Commission may declare carriage services and related\nservices to be declared services.\nsubstitute:\n•\nA carriage service, or a related service, supplied, or capable\nof being supplied, by a carrier (other than an NBN\ncorporation) or a carriage service provider (other than an\nNBN corporation) is a declared service if:\n\n(a)\nthe Commission has declared the service to be a\ndeclared service; or\n\n(b)\nthe service is supplied by the carrier or carriage\nservice provider, and a special access undertaking\ngiven by the carrier or carriage service provider is\nin operation in relation to the service.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nGeneral amendments  Part 1\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband Network\nMeasures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011          21\n•\nA carriage service, or a related service, supplied, or capable\nof being supplied, by an NBN corporation is a declared\nservice if:\n\n(a)\nthe Commission has declared the service to be a\ndeclared service; or\n\n(b)\nthe NBN corporation has formulated a standard\nform of access agreement that relates to access to\nthe service; or\n\n(c)\nthe service is supplied by the NBN corporation,\nand a special access undertaking given by the NBN\ncorporation is in operation in relation to the\nservice.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-30-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-30-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "bcacbfdf6356f8d403e5d47034fb33b7f810304232bbdbacbce2a317e36608ae",
      "skos:note": "A carriage service or related service is a declared service if the Commission has declared it so."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-30",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "30 Section 152AA",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 24,
      "values:originalText": "Omit:\n•\nThe Commission may declare carriage services and related\nservices to be declared services.\nsubstitute:\n•\nA carriage service, or a related service, supplied, or capable\nof being supplied, by a carrier (other than an NBN\ncorporation) or a carriage service provider (other than an\nNBN corporation) is a declared service if:\n\n(a)\nthe Commission has declared the service to be a\ndeclared service; or\n\n(b)\nthe service is supplied by the carrier or carriage\nservice provider, and a special access undertaking\ngiven by the carrier or carriage service provider is\nin operation in relation to the service.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nGeneral amendments  Part 1\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband Network\nMeasures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011          21\n•\nA carriage service, or a related service, supplied, or capable\nof being supplied, by an NBN corporation is a declared\nservice if:\n\n(a)\nthe Commission has declared the service to be a\ndeclared service; or\n\n(b)\nthe NBN corporation has formulated a standard\nform of access agreement that relates to access to\nthe service; or\n\n(c)\nthe service is supplied by the NBN corporation,\nand a special access undertaking given by the NBN\ncorporation is in operation in relation to the\nservice."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-30-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-30"
      },
