      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.26",
      "values:originalText": "(3B) Before commencing to hold a public inquiry under Part 25 of the\nTelecommunications Act 1997 about a proposal to make a\ndeclaration under subsection (3) in relation to an eligible service,\nthe Commission must consider whether to hold a public inquiry\nunder that Part about a proposal to make a declaration under\nsubsection (8A) in relation to the service.\nNote:\nFor combined public inquiries, see section 152AN.\nNote:\nThe heading to subsection 152AL(3) is altered by adding at the end “—services not\nsupplied by an NBN corporation”.",
      "skos:definition": "(3B) Before commencing to hold a public inquiry under Part 25 of the\nTelecommunications Act 1997 about a proposal to make a\ndeclaration under subsection (3) in relation to an eligible service,\nthe Commission must consider whether to hold a public inquiry\nunder that Part about a proposal to make a declaration under\nsubsection (8A) in relation to the service.\nNote:\nFor combined public inquiries, see section 152AN.\nNote:\nThe heading to subsection 152AL(3) is altered by adding at the end “—services not\nsupplied by an NBN corporation”.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-38"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-38-ss-3b-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-38-ss-3b-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-38-ss-3b-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-38-ss-3b-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-38-ss-3b-logic-argumentation-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "bdf4a4f435c13f484a374fe051343af32cadb15007be139d92459ba431ecf6cc",
      "skos:note": "Commission must consider holding a public inquiry about another proposal before commencing to hold an inquiry about the first proposal."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-38-ss-3b",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "38(3B) After subsection 152AL(3)",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 26,
      "values:originalText": "(3B) Before commencing to hold a public inquiry under Part 25 of the\nTelecommunications Act 1997 about a proposal to make a\ndeclaration under subsection (3) in relation to an eligible service,\nthe Commission must consider whether to hold a public inquiry\nunder that Part about a proposal to make a declaration under\nsubsection (8A) in relation to the service.\nNote:\nFor combined public inquiries, see section 152AN.\nNote:\nThe heading to subsection 152AL(3) is altered by adding at the end “—services not\nsupplied by an NBN corporation”."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-38-ss-3b-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
