      },
      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.27",
      "values:originalText": "(8D) If:\n\n(a) an eligible service is supplied, or is capable of being\nsupplied, by an NBN corporation (whether to itself or to\nother persons); and\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "skos:definition": "(8D) If:\n\n(a) an eligible service is supplied, or is capable of being\nsupplied, by an NBN corporation (whether to itself or to\nother persons); and\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-41"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
