    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-41-ss-8d",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41(8D) After subsection 152AL(8)",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 27,
      "values:originalText": "(8D) If:\n\n(a) an eligible service is supplied, or is capable of being\nsupplied, by an NBN corporation (whether to itself or to\nother persons); and\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-41-ss-8d-norm",
