    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-24-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "24 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-24-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2012c00870.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.28",
      "values:originalText": "Network Measures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011\n\n(b) the NBN corporation is a carrier or a carriage service\nprovider; and\n\n(c) the NBN corporation has formulated a standard form of\naccess agreement that relates to access to the service; and\n\n(d) the standard form of access agreement is available on the\nNBN corporation’s website;\nthen:\n\n(e) the service, to the extent to which it is supplied, or is capable\nof being supplied, by the NBN corporation (whether to itself\nor to other persons) is a declared service; and\n\n(f) the declared service relates to the NBN corporation for the\npurposes of subsections 152AXB(2) and 152AXC(7).\nServices covered by special access undertakings—services\nsupplied by an NBN corporation\n\n(8E) If:\n\n(a) an NBN corporation gives the Commission a special access\nundertaking in relation to a service or a proposed service; and\n\n(b) the undertaking is in operation; and\n\n(c) the NBN corporation supplies the service or proposed service\n(whether to itself or to other persons);\nthen:\n\n(d) the service supplied by the NBN corporation is a declared\nservice; and\n\n(e) the declared service relates to the NBN corporation for the\npurposes of subsections 152AXB(2) and 152AXC(7).\nTo avoid doubt, if the undertaking is subject to limitations, the\nservice supplied by the NBN corporation is a declared service only\nto the extent to which the service falls within the scope of the\nlimitations.\n\n(8F) The Commission may declare a service under subsection (8A) even\nif the service is, to any extent, covered by subsection (8E).",
      "skos:definition": "Network Measures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011\n\n(b) the NBN corporation is a carrier or a carriage service\nprovider; and\n\n(c) the NBN corporation has formulated a standard form of\naccess agreement that relates to access to the service; and\n\n(d) the standard form of access agreement is available on the\nNBN corporation’s website;\nthen:\n\n(e) the service, to the extent to which it is supplied, or is capable\nof being supplied, by the NBN corporation (whether to itself\nor to other persons) is a declared service; and\n\n(f) the declared service relates to the NBN corporation for the\npurposes of subsections 152AXB(2) and 152AXC(7).\nServices covered by special access undertakings—services\nsupplied by an NBN corporation\n\n(8E) If:\n\n(a) an NBN corporation gives the Commission a special access\nundertaking in relation to a service or a proposed service; and\n\n(b) the undertaking is in operation; and\n\n(c) the NBN corporation supplies the service or proposed service\n(whether to itself or to other persons);\nthen:\n\n(d) the service supplied by the NBN corporation is a declared\nservice; and\n\n(e) the declared service relates to the NBN corporation for the\npurposes of subsections 152AXB(2) and 152AXC(7).\nTo avoid doubt, if the undertaking is subject to limitations, the\nservice supplied by the NBN corporation is a declared service only\nto the extent to which the service falls within the scope of the\nlimitations.\n\n(8F) The Commission may declare a service under subsection (8A) even\nif the service is, to any extent, covered by subsection (8E).",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-24-2-ss-8e"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-24-2-ss-8f"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3e4439f230fffaac59da4111a5acde990718f4ebdc9d8f9b885b7f62b4d06330"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-24-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "24 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 28,
      "values:originalText": "Network Measures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011\n\n(b) the NBN corporation is a carrier or a carriage service\nprovider; and\n\n(c) the NBN corporation has formulated a standard form of\naccess agreement that relates to access to the service; and\n\n(d) the standard form of access agreement is available on the\nNBN corporation’s website;\nthen:\n\n(e) the service, to the extent to which it is supplied, or is capable\nof being supplied, by the NBN corporation (whether to itself\nor to other persons) is a declared service; and\n\n(f) the declared service relates to the NBN corporation for the\npurposes of subsections 152AXB(2) and 152AXC(7).\nServices covered by special access undertakings—services\nsupplied by an NBN corporation\n\n(8E) If:\n\n(a) an NBN corporation gives the Commission a special access\nundertaking in relation to a service or a proposed service; and\n\n(b) the undertaking is in operation; and\n\n(c) the NBN corporation supplies the service or proposed service\n(whether to itself or to other persons);\nthen:\n\n(d) the service supplied by the NBN corporation is a declared\nservice; and\n\n(e) the declared service relates to the NBN corporation for the\npurposes of subsections 152AXB(2) and 152AXC(7).\nTo avoid doubt, if the undertaking is subject to limitations, the\nservice supplied by the NBN corporation is a declared service only\nto the extent to which the service falls within the scope of the\nlimitations.\n\n(8F) The Commission may declare a service under subsection (8A) even\nif the service is, to any extent, covered by subsection (8E)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-24-2-ss-8e",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "24(8E) Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-24-2-ss-8e"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2012c00870.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.28",
      "values:originalText": "(8E) If:\n\n(a) an NBN corporation gives the Commission a special access\nundertaking in relation to a service or a proposed service; and\n\n(b) the undertaking is in operation; and\n\n(c) the NBN corporation supplies the service or proposed service\n(whether to itself or to other persons);\nthen:\n\n(d) the service supplied by the NBN corporation is a declared\nservice; and\n\n(e) the declared service relates to the NBN corporation for the\npurposes of subsections 152AXB(2) and 152AXC(7).\nTo avoid doubt, if the undertaking is subject to limitations, the\nservice supplied by the NBN corporation is a declared service only\nto the extent to which the service falls within the scope of the\nlimitations.",
      "skos:definition": "(8E) If:\n\n(a) an NBN corporation gives the Commission a special access\nundertaking in relation to a service or a proposed service; and\n\n(b) the undertaking is in operation; and\n\n(c) the NBN corporation supplies the service or proposed service\n(whether to itself or to other persons);\nthen:\n\n(d) the service supplied by the NBN corporation is a declared\nservice; and\n\n(e) the declared service relates to the NBN corporation for the\npurposes of subsections 152AXB(2) and 152AXC(7).\nTo avoid doubt, if the undertaking is subject to limitations, the\nservice supplied by the NBN corporation is a declared service only\nto the extent to which the service falls within the scope of the\nlimitations.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-24-2"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-24-2-ss-8e-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "07ed156308edee99c280b5f9ef53f516ab26c2bf229a5aeea6037ea5393656d7",
      "skos:note": "NBN corporation's special access undertaking determines declared service"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-24-2-ss-8e",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "24(8E) Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 28,
      "values:originalText": "(8E) If:\n\n(a) an NBN corporation gives the Commission a special access\nundertaking in relation to a service or a proposed service; and\n\n(b) the undertaking is in operation; and\n\n(c) the NBN corporation supplies the service or proposed service\n(whether to itself or to other persons);\nthen:\n\n(d) the service supplied by the NBN corporation is a declared\nservice; and\n\n(e) the declared service relates to the NBN corporation for the\npurposes of subsections 152AXB(2) and 152AXC(7).\nTo avoid doubt, if the undertaking is subject to limitations, the\nservice supplied by the NBN corporation is a declared service only\nto the extent to which the service falls within the scope of the\nlimitations."
    },
    {
