      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.28",
      "values:originalText": "(8F) The Commission may declare a service under subsection (8A) even\nif the service is, to any extent, covered by subsection (8E).",
      "skos:definition": "(8F) The Commission may declare a service under subsection (8A) even\nif the service is, to any extent, covered by subsection (8E).",
      "values:partOf": {
