      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.28",
      "values:originalText": "After “and (c)”, insert “, or paragraphs 152AL(8A)(a), (b) and (c), as\nthe case requires,”.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nGeneral amendments  Part 1\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband Network\nMeasures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011          25",
      "skos:definition": "After “and (c)”, insert “, or paragraphs 152AL(8A)(a), (b) and (c), as\nthe case requires,”.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nGeneral amendments  Part 1\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband Network\nMeasures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011          25",
