        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-26-2-ss-5-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "33e6951f404a548ed2f10533415cd9de2946d17b421e573abbf659e824884a61",
      "skos:note": "Must provide necessary service to enable carriage services and/or content services.",
      "dc:description": "true"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-26-2-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "26(5) Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 30,
      "values:originalText": "(5) If:\n\n(a) an NBN corporation is a carrier or carriage service provider;\nand\n\n(b) the NBN corporation supplies a declared service by means of\nconditional-access customer equipment;\nthe NBN corporation must, if requested to do so by a service\nprovider who has made a request referred to in subsection (2),\nsupply to the service provider any service that is necessary to\nenable the service provider to supply carriage services and/or\ncontent services by means of the declared service and using the\nequipment.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments"
    },
