      },
      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.32",
      "values:originalText": "(1) An NBN corporation must not, in complying with any of its\ncategory B standard access obligations, discriminate between\naccess seekers.\nNote:\nFor explanatory material, see section 152CJH.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nGeneral amendments  Part 1\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband Network\nMeasures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011          29",
      "skos:definition": "(1) An NBN corporation must not, in complying with any of its\ncategory B standard access obligations, discriminate between\naccess seekers.\nNote:\nFor explanatory material, see section 152CJH.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nGeneral amendments  Part 1\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband Network\nMeasures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011          29",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-28-2"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-28-2-ss-1-norm"
        },
