    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-28-2-ss-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "28(7) Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-28-2-ss-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2012c00870.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.32",
      "values:originalText": "(7) If:\n\n(a) an NBN corporation is a carrier or carriage service provider;\nand\n\n(b) under subsection 152AL(8A), (8D) or (8E), a declared\nservice relates to the NBN corporation; and\n\n(c) the NBN corporation is subject to a category B standard\naccess obligation in relation to the service;\nthe NBN corporation must not discriminate in favour of itself in\nrelation to the supply of the service.\nAuthorised conduct",
      "skos:definition": "(7) If:\n\n(a) an NBN corporation is a carrier or carriage service provider;\nand\n\n(b) under subsection 152AL(8A), (8D) or (8E), a declared\nservice relates to the NBN corporation; and\n\n(c) the NBN corporation is subject to a category B standard\naccess obligation in relation to the service;\nthe NBN corporation must not discriminate in favour of itself in\nrelation to the supply of the service.\nAuthorised conduct",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-28-2"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-28-2-ss-7-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-28-2-ss-7-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-28-2-ss-7-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-28-2-ss-7-logic-argumentation-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-28-2-ss-7-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
