      },
      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.32",
      "values:originalText": "(1) An NBN corporation must not, in carrying on any of the following\nactivities, discriminate between access seekers:\n\n(a) developing a new eligible service;\n\n(b) enhancing a declared service;\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "skos:definition": "(1) An NBN corporation must not, in carrying on any of the following\nactivities, discriminate between access seekers:\n\n(a) developing a new eligible service;\n\n(b) enhancing a declared service;\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "values:partOf": {
