    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-58a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "58A After subsection 152BCB(3A)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-58a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2012c00870.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.36",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(3B) The Commission must not make an access determination that\nwould have the effect of:\n\n(a) requiring an NBN corporation to engage in conduct that is\ninconsistent with conduct authorised under subsection\n151DA(2) or (3) for the purposes of subsection 51(1); or\n\n(b) preventing an NBN corporation from giving a refusal that is\nauthorised under subsection 151DA(3) for the purposes of\nsubsection 51(1).\n\n(3C) The Commission must not make an access determination that\nwould have the effect of preventing an NBN corporation from\nengaging in conduct that is reasonably necessary to achieve\nuniform national pricing of eligible services supplied by the NBN\ncorporation to service providers and utilities.\n\n(3D) In subsection (3C), eligible services, uniform national pricing and\nutilities have the same meaning as in section 151DA.",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n\n(3B) The Commission must not make an access determination that\nwould have the effect of:\n\n(a) requiring an NBN corporation to engage in conduct that is\ninconsistent with conduct authorised under subsection\n151DA(2) or (3) for the purposes of subsection 51(1); or\n\n(b) preventing an NBN corporation from giving a refusal that is\nauthorised under subsection 151DA(3) for the purposes of\nsubsection 51(1).\n\n(3C) The Commission must not make an access determination that\nwould have the effect of preventing an NBN corporation from\nengaging in conduct that is reasonably necessary to achieve\nuniform national pricing of eligible services supplied by the NBN\ncorporation to service providers and utilities.\n\n(3D) In subsection (3C), eligible services, uniform national pricing and\nutilities have the same meaning as in section 151DA.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-58a-ss-3b"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-58a-ss-3c"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-58a-ss-3d"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8445d5cfe714f4491bdd7be3a32948e53e2a96ef2d6d75ca8d501fbc73a359c4"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-58a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "58A After subsection 152BCB(3A)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 36,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(3B) The Commission must not make an access determination that\nwould have the effect of:\n\n(a) requiring an NBN corporation to engage in conduct that is\ninconsistent with conduct authorised under subsection\n151DA(2) or (3) for the purposes of subsection 51(1); or\n\n(b) preventing an NBN corporation from giving a refusal that is\nauthorised under subsection 151DA(3) for the purposes of\nsubsection 51(1).\n\n(3C) The Commission must not make an access determination that\nwould have the effect of preventing an NBN corporation from\nengaging in conduct that is reasonably necessary to achieve\nuniform national pricing of eligible services supplied by the NBN\ncorporation to service providers and utilities.\n\n(3D) In subsection (3C), eligible services, uniform national pricing and\nutilities have the same meaning as in section 151DA."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-58a-ss-3b",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "58A(3B) After subsection 152BCB(3A)",
