      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "64A(3D) After subsection 152BDA(3A)",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 38,
      "values:originalText": "(3D) In subsection (3C), eligible services, uniform national pricing and\nutilities have the same meaning as in section 151DA."
    },
