      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.42",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Commission is to maintain a register, to be known as the\nRegister of NBN Access Agreement Statements, in which the\nCommission includes all statements given to it under the following\nprovisions:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Commission is to maintain a register, to be known as the\nRegister of NBN Access Agreement Statements, in which the\nCommission includes all statements given to it under the following\nprovisions:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-38-2"
      },
