    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-72",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "72 After subsection 152CBA(3)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-72"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2012c00870.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.45",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(3A) If paragraph (1)(b) applies, the undertaking must state that, in the\nevent that the person supplies, or becomes capable of supplying,\nthe service (whether to itself or to other persons), the person:\n\n(a) agrees to be bound by the obligations referred to in\nsection 152AXB, to the extent that those obligations would\napply to the person in relation to the service if the service\nwere treated as a declared service; and\n\n(b) undertakes to comply with the terms and conditions specified\nin the undertaking in relation to the obligations referred to in\nsection 152AXB.\nNote:\nThe undertaking need not specify all terms and conditions—see\nsubparagraph 152AY(2)(b)(ii).",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n\n(3A) If paragraph (1)(b) applies, the undertaking must state that, in the\nevent that the person supplies, or becomes capable of supplying,\nthe service (whether to itself or to other persons), the person:\n\n(a) agrees to be bound by the obligations referred to in\nsection 152AXB, to the extent that those obligations would\napply to the person in relation to the service if the service\nwere treated as a declared service; and\n\n(b) undertakes to comply with the terms and conditions specified\nin the undertaking in relation to the obligations referred to in\nsection 152AXB.\nNote:\nThe undertaking need not specify all terms and conditions—see\nsubparagraph 152AY(2)(b)(ii).",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-72-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-72-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "db0e003bfa4bfacc4d4e17cda1fa4f65cbd20e18d1fbf649bc5ab8fb68b6e8ba",
      "skos:note": "Agreement to comply with obligations and terms and conditions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-72",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "72 After subsection 152CBA(3)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 45,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(3A) If paragraph (1)(b) applies, the undertaking must state that, in the\nevent that the person supplies, or becomes capable of supplying,\nthe service (whether to itself or to other persons), the person:\n\n(a) agrees to be bound by the obligations referred to in\nsection 152AXB, to the extent that those obligations would\napply to the person in relation to the service if the service\nwere treated as a declared service; and\n\n(b) undertakes to comply with the terms and conditions specified\nin the undertaking in relation to the obligations referred to in\nsection 152AXB.\nNote:\nThe undertaking need not specify all terms and conditions—see\nsubparagraph 152AY(2)(b)(ii)."
    },
