    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-42-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "42 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-42-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2012c00870.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.46",
      "values:originalText": "Network Measures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011\n\n(3C) If the person is an NBN corporation, the undertaking may also state\nthat the NBN corporation will engage in specified conduct in\nrelation to:\n\n(a) developing a new eligible service (within the meaning of\nsection 152AL); or\n\n(b) enhancing a declared service; or\n\n(c) extending or enhancing the capability of a facility or\ntelecommunications network by means of which a declared\nservice is, or is to be, supplied; or\n\n(d) planning for a facility or telecommunications network by\nmeans of which a declared service is, or is to be, supplied; or\n\n(e) an activity that is preparatory to the supply of a declared\nservice; or\n\n(f) an activity that is ancillary or incidental to the supply of a\ndeclared service; or\n\n(g) giving information to service providers about any of the\nabove activities.\n\n(3D) For the purposes of this Part, in determining whether the\nundertaking relates to a particular service or proposed service,\ndisregard a statement included in the undertaking in accordance\nwith subsection (3C).",
      "skos:definition": "Network Measures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011\n\n(3C) If the person is an NBN corporation, the undertaking may also state\nthat the NBN corporation will engage in specified conduct in\nrelation to:\n\n(a) developing a new eligible service (within the meaning of\nsection 152AL); or\n\n(b) enhancing a declared service; or\n\n(c) extending or enhancing the capability of a facility or\ntelecommunications network by means of which a declared\nservice is, or is to be, supplied; or\n\n(d) planning for a facility or telecommunications network by\nmeans of which a declared service is, or is to be, supplied; or\n\n(e) an activity that is preparatory to the supply of a declared\nservice; or\n\n(f) an activity that is ancillary or incidental to the supply of a\ndeclared service; or\n\n(g) giving information to service providers about any of the\nabove activities.\n\n(3D) For the purposes of this Part, in determining whether the\nundertaking relates to a particular service or proposed service,\ndisregard a statement included in the undertaking in accordance\nwith subsection (3C).",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-42-2-ss-3c"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-42-2-ss-3d"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "bc806b2c26ce22cd25c65c81147bd806a1f45bd04468bfcf1248ff1791822f94"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-42-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "42 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 46,
      "values:originalText": "Network Measures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011\n\n(3C) If the person is an NBN corporation, the undertaking may also state\nthat the NBN corporation will engage in specified conduct in\nrelation to:\n\n(a) developing a new eligible service (within the meaning of\nsection 152AL); or\n\n(b) enhancing a declared service; or\n\n(c) extending or enhancing the capability of a facility or\ntelecommunications network by means of which a declared\nservice is, or is to be, supplied; or\n\n(d) planning for a facility or telecommunications network by\nmeans of which a declared service is, or is to be, supplied; or\n\n(e) an activity that is preparatory to the supply of a declared\nservice; or\n\n(f) an activity that is ancillary or incidental to the supply of a\ndeclared service; or\n\n(g) giving information to service providers about any of the\nabove activities.\n\n(3D) For the purposes of this Part, in determining whether the\nundertaking relates to a particular service or proposed service,\ndisregard a statement included in the undertaking in accordance\nwith subsection (3C)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-42-2-ss-3c",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "42(3C) Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-42-2-ss-3c"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2012c00870.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.46",
      "values:originalText": "(3C) If the person is an NBN corporation, the undertaking may also state\nthat the NBN corporation will engage in specified conduct in\nrelation to:\n\n(a) developing a new eligible service (within the meaning of\nsection 152AL); or\n\n(b) enhancing a declared service; or\n\n(c) extending or enhancing the capability of a facility or\ntelecommunications network by means of which a declared\nservice is, or is to be, supplied; or\n\n(d) planning for a facility or telecommunications network by\nmeans of which a declared service is, or is to be, supplied; or\n\n(e) an activity that is preparatory to the supply of a declared\nservice; or\n\n(f) an activity that is ancillary or incidental to the supply of a\ndeclared service; or\n\n(g) giving information to service providers about any of the\nabove activities.",
      "skos:definition": "(3C) If the person is an NBN corporation, the undertaking may also state\nthat the NBN corporation will engage in specified conduct in\nrelation to:\n\n(a) developing a new eligible service (within the meaning of\nsection 152AL); or\n\n(b) enhancing a declared service; or\n\n(c) extending or enhancing the capability of a facility or\ntelecommunications network by means of which a declared\nservice is, or is to be, supplied; or\n\n(d) planning for a facility or telecommunications network by\nmeans of which a declared service is, or is to be, supplied; or\n\n(e) an activity that is preparatory to the supply of a declared\nservice; or\n\n(f) an activity that is ancillary or incidental to the supply of a\ndeclared service; or\n\n(g) giving information to service providers about any of the\nabove activities.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-42-2"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-42-2-ss-3c-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-42-2-ss-3c-logic-descriptionlogic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-42-2-ss-3c-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8715d5f8a00a4fd724f6fe61cc0c542e1a62453b4d0cd4813f0e67cfc17f178a",
      "skos:note": "NBN corporation's conduct in relation to declared services"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-42-2-ss-3c",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "42(3C) Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 46,
      "values:originalText": "(3C) If the person is an NBN corporation, the undertaking may also state\nthat the NBN corporation will engage in specified conduct in\nrelation to:\n\n(a) developing a new eligible service (within the meaning of\nsection 152AL); or\n\n(b) enhancing a declared service; or\n\n(c) extending or enhancing the capability of a facility or\ntelecommunications network by means of which a declared\nservice is, or is to be, supplied; or\n\n(d) planning for a facility or telecommunications network by\nmeans of which a declared service is, or is to be, supplied; or\n\n(e) an activity that is preparatory to the supply of a declared\nservice; or\n\n(f) an activity that is ancillary or incidental to the supply of a\ndeclared service; or\n\n(g) giving information to service providers about any of the\nabove activities."
    },
