      },
      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.47",
      "values:originalText": "(5C) If a refusal is authorised under subsection 151DA(2) or (3) for the\npurposes of subsection 51(1):\n\n(a) the Commission must not reject the undertaking for a reason\nthat concerns that refusal; and\n\n(b) paragraph (2)(b) of this section does not apply to that refusal.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "skos:definition": "(5C) If a refusal is authorised under subsection 151DA(2) or (3) for the\npurposes of subsection 51(1):\n\n(a) the Commission must not reject the undertaking for a reason\nthat concerns that refusal; and\n\n(b) paragraph (2)(b) of this section does not apply to that refusal.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-76a"
      },
