      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 50,
      "values:originalText": "(2) If an NBN corporation is a service provider, the NBN corporation\nmust comply with any rules in section 152CJA that are applicable\nto the NBN corporation.\n152CJE  Judicial enforcement of obligations"
    },
