    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-140",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "140 Simplified outline",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-140"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2012c00870.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.56",
      "values:originalText": "The following is a simplified outline of this Part:\n•\nA local access line that belongs to a telecommunications\nnetwork (other than the national broadband network) must not\nbe used to supply a fixed-line carriage service if:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nAmendments relating to Layer 2 bitstream services  Part 3\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband Network\nMeasures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011          53\n\n(a)\nthe network is used, or is proposed to be used, to\nsupply a superfast carriage service wholly or\nprincipally to residential or small business\ncustomers, or prospective residential or small\nbusiness customers, in Australia; and\n\n(b)\nno Layer 2 bitstream service is available for supply\nto those customers or prospective customers using\nthe network; and\n\n(c)\nthe network came into existence, or was upgraded,\non or after 1 January 2011.",
      "skos:definition": "The following is a simplified outline of this Part:\n•\nA local access line that belongs to a telecommunications\nnetwork (other than the national broadband network) must not\nbe used to supply a fixed-line carriage service if:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nAmendments relating to Layer 2 bitstream services  Part 3\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband Network\nMeasures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011          53\n\n(a)\nthe network is used, or is proposed to be used, to\nsupply a superfast carriage service wholly or\nprincipally to residential or small business\ncustomers, or prospective residential or small\nbusiness customers, in Australia; and\n\n(b)\nno Layer 2 bitstream service is available for supply\nto those customers or prospective customers using\nthe network; and\n\n(c)\nthe network came into existence, or was upgraded,\non or after 1 January 2011.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-140-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8909e78fc7f2f05b8a90ec28c092358a3e0e20fbd6791a0b4a4cf20c972c9a3e",
      "skos:note": "Local access line must not supply fixed-line carriage service under certain conditions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-140",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "140 Simplified outline",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 56,
      "values:originalText": "The following is a simplified outline of this Part:\n•\nA local access line that belongs to a telecommunications\nnetwork (other than the national broadband network) must not\nbe used to supply a fixed-line carriage service if:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nAmendments relating to Layer 2 bitstream services  Part 3\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband Network\nMeasures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011          53\n\n(a)\nthe network is used, or is proposed to be used, to\nsupply a superfast carriage service wholly or\nprincipally to residential or small business\ncustomers, or prospective residential or small\nbusiness customers, in Australia; and\n\n(b)\nno Layer 2 bitstream service is available for supply\nto those customers or prospective customers using\nthe network; and\n\n(c)\nthe network came into existence, or was upgraded,\non or after 1 January 2011."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-140-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-140"
