    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-141b",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "141B Deemed networks",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-141b"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2012c00870.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.60",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) a telecommunications network is altered or upgraded on or\nafter 1 January 2011; and\n\n(b) as a result of the alteration or upgrade, a part of the network\nbecame capable of being used to supply a superfast carriage\nservice to residential or small business customers, or\nprospective residential or small business customers, in\nAustralia;\nthen:\n\n(c) that part is taken to be a network in its own right; and\n\n(d) the network referred to in paragraph (c) is taken to have come\ninto existence on or after 1 January 2011.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) a telecommunications network is extended on or after",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) a telecommunications network is altered or upgraded on or\nafter 1 January 2011; and\n\n(b) as a result of the alteration or upgrade, a part of the network\nbecame capable of being used to supply a superfast carriage\nservice to residential or small business customers, or\nprospective residential or small business customers, in\nAustralia;\nthen:\n\n(c) that part is taken to be a network in its own right; and\n\n(d) the network referred to in paragraph (c) is taken to have come\ninto existence on or after 1 January 2011.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) a telecommunications network is extended on or after",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-141b-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-141b-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "29016c152c1fec26313987da7792d96564692d1bf0d1ee9e621a7a23ea0771ca"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-141b",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "141B Deemed networks",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 60,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) a telecommunications network is altered or upgraded on or\nafter 1 January 2011; and\n\n(b) as a result of the alteration or upgrade, a part of the network\nbecame capable of being used to supply a superfast carriage\nservice to residential or small business customers, or\nprospective residential or small business customers, in\nAustralia;\nthen:\n\n(c) that part is taken to be a network in its own right; and\n\n(d) the network referred to in paragraph (c) is taken to have come\ninto existence on or after 1 January 2011.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) a telecommunications network is extended on or after"
    },
