      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.67",
      "values:originalText": "(5) Subsection 143(2) does not apply if:\n\n(a) both:\n\n(i) the eligible service is a carriage service; and\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "skos:definition": "(5) Subsection 143(2) does not apply if:\n\n(a) both:\n\n(i) the eligible service is a carriage service; and\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
