    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-146",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "146 Exemption—electricity supply bodies",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-146"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2012c00870.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.68",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Subsection 143(2) does not apply if:\n\n(a) the eligible service is a carriage service, and the sole use of\nthe carriage service is use by an electricity supply body to\ncarry communications necessary or desirable for:\n\n(i) managing the generation, transmission, distribution or\nsupply of electricity; or\n\n(ii) charging for the supply of electricity; or\n\n(b) the eligible service is a service that facilitates the supply of a\ncarriage service covered by paragraph (a) of this section.\n\n(2) Paragraph (1)(a) does not apply to a carriage service supplied to an\nelectricity supply body unless the carriage service is supplied on\nthe basis that the electricity supply body must not re-supply the\ncarriage service.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Subsection 143(2) does not apply if:\n\n(a) the eligible service is a carriage service, and the sole use of\nthe carriage service is use by an electricity supply body to\ncarry communications necessary or desirable for:\n\n(i) managing the generation, transmission, distribution or\nsupply of electricity; or\n\n(ii) charging for the supply of electricity; or\n\n(b) the eligible service is a service that facilitates the supply of a\ncarriage service covered by paragraph (a) of this section.\n\n(2) Paragraph (1)(a) does not apply to a carriage service supplied to an\nelectricity supply body unless the carriage service is supplied on\nthe basis that the electricity supply body must not re-supply the\ncarriage service.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-146-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-146-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c0cb1ffcacc4e8e589d25b180ab45c374b7926b6b455c0582d18c16f1bde2b37"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-146",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "146 Exemption—electricity supply bodies",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 68,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Subsection 143(2) does not apply if:\n\n(a) the eligible service is a carriage service, and the sole use of\nthe carriage service is use by an electricity supply body to\ncarry communications necessary or desirable for:\n\n(i) managing the generation, transmission, distribution or\nsupply of electricity; or\n\n(ii) charging for the supply of electricity; or\n\n(b) the eligible service is a service that facilitates the supply of a\ncarriage service covered by paragraph (a) of this section.\n\n(2) Paragraph (1)(a) does not apply to a carriage service supplied to an\nelectricity supply body unless the carriage service is supplied on\nthe basis that the electricity supply body must not re-supply the\ncarriage service."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-146-ss-1",
