      "values:originalText": "(2) Paragraph (1)(a) does not apply to a carriage service supplied to an\nelectricity supply body unless the carriage service is supplied on\nthe basis that the electricity supply body must not re-supply the\ncarriage service.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Paragraph (1)(a) does not apply to a carriage service supplied to an\nelectricity supply body unless the carriage service is supplied on\nthe basis that the electricity supply body must not re-supply the\ncarriage service.",
