    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-147",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "147 Exemption—gas supply bodies",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-147"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2012c00870.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.68",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Subsection 143(2) does not apply if:\n\n(a) the eligible service is a carriage service, and the sole use of\nthe carriage service is use by a gas supply body to carry\ncommunications necessary or desirable for:\n\n(i) managing the transmission or distribution of natural gas\nin a pipeline; or\n\n(ii) charging for the supply of natural gas transmitted or\ndistributed in a pipeline; or\n\n(b) the eligible service is a service that facilitates the supply of a\ncarriage service covered by paragraph (a) of this section.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nAmendments relating to Layer 2 bitstream services  Part 3\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband Network\nMeasures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011          65\n\n(2) Paragraph (1)(a) does not apply to a carriage service supplied to a\ngas supply body unless the carriage service is supplied on the basis\nthat the gas supply body must not re-supply the carriage service.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Subsection 143(2) does not apply if:\n\n(a) the eligible service is a carriage service, and the sole use of\nthe carriage service is use by a gas supply body to carry\ncommunications necessary or desirable for:\n\n(i) managing the transmission or distribution of natural gas\nin a pipeline; or\n\n(ii) charging for the supply of natural gas transmitted or\ndistributed in a pipeline; or\n\n(b) the eligible service is a service that facilitates the supply of a\ncarriage service covered by paragraph (a) of this section.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nAmendments relating to Layer 2 bitstream services  Part 3\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband Network\nMeasures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011          65\n\n(2) Paragraph (1)(a) does not apply to a carriage service supplied to a\ngas supply body unless the carriage service is supplied on the basis\nthat the gas supply body must not re-supply the carriage service.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-147-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-147-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ef3831210acfc9247bfb0585878bc2a621973a7c9d9a2a20a9bfd9c7ba004b3b"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-147",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "147 Exemption—gas supply bodies",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 68,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Subsection 143(2) does not apply if:\n\n(a) the eligible service is a carriage service, and the sole use of\nthe carriage service is use by a gas supply body to carry\ncommunications necessary or desirable for:\n\n(i) managing the transmission or distribution of natural gas\nin a pipeline; or\n\n(ii) charging for the supply of natural gas transmitted or\ndistributed in a pipeline; or\n\n(b) the eligible service is a service that facilitates the supply of a\ncarriage service covered by paragraph (a) of this section.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nAmendments relating to Layer 2 bitstream services  Part 3\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband Network\nMeasures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011          65\n\n(2) Paragraph (1)(a) does not apply to a carriage service supplied to a\ngas supply body unless the carriage service is supplied on the basis\nthat the gas supply body must not re-supply the carriage service."
    },
