    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-66-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "66 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-66-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2012c00870.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.70",
      "values:originalText": "Network Measures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011\n\n(a) the eligible service is a carriage service, and the sole use of\nthe carriage service is use by a storm water drainage services\nbody to carry communications necessary or desirable for:\n\n(i) managing the supply of storm water drainage services;\nor\n\n(ii) charging for the supply of storm water drainage\nservices; or\n\n(b) the eligible service is a service that facilitates the supply of a\ncarriage service covered by paragraph (a) of this section.\n\n(2) Paragraph (1)(a) does not apply to a carriage service supplied to a\nstorm water drainage services body unless the carriage service is\nsupplied on the basis that the storm water drainage services body\nmust not re-supply the carriage service.",
      "skos:definition": "Network Measures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011\n\n(a) the eligible service is a carriage service, and the sole use of\nthe carriage service is use by a storm water drainage services\nbody to carry communications necessary or desirable for:\n\n(i) managing the supply of storm water drainage services;\nor\n\n(ii) charging for the supply of storm water drainage\nservices; or\n\n(b) the eligible service is a service that facilitates the supply of a\ncarriage service covered by paragraph (a) of this section.\n\n(2) Paragraph (1)(a) does not apply to a carriage service supplied to a\nstorm water drainage services body unless the carriage service is\nsupplied on the basis that the storm water drainage services body\nmust not re-supply the carriage service.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-66-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-66-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-66-2-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-66-2-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-66-2-logic-deontic-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1bcc394927f8ee91d4f435e1fa6494abd84f96ed96f22832b7fd7668e3293c77",
      "skos:note": "Storm water drainage services bodies cannot use carriage services for managing supply or charging without permission."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-66-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "66 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 70,
      "values:originalText": "Network Measures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011\n\n(a) the eligible service is a carriage service, and the sole use of\nthe carriage service is use by a storm water drainage services\nbody to carry communications necessary or desirable for:\n\n(i) managing the supply of storm water drainage services;\nor\n\n(ii) charging for the supply of storm water drainage\nservices; or\n\n(b) the eligible service is a service that facilitates the supply of a\ncarriage service covered by paragraph (a) of this section.\n\n(2) Paragraph (1)(a) does not apply to a carriage service supplied to a\nstorm water drainage services body unless the carriage service is\nsupplied on the basis that the storm water drainage services body\nmust not re-supply the carriage service."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-66-2-norm",
