      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The eligible service is a carriage service, and the sole use of the carriage service is use by a storm water drainage services body to carry communications necessary or desirable for managing the supply of storm water drainage services; or"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-66-2-logic-alleninterval-2",
