      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) the eligible service is a carriage service, and the sole use of the carriage service is use by a storm water drainage services body to carry communications necessary or desirable for managing the supply of storm water drainage services; or"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-66-2-logic-ltl-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LTL"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Recurring Trace",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Recurring trace for using carriage services.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::temporal_ltl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) the eligible service is a carriage service, and the sole use of the carriage service is use by a storm water drainage services body to carry communications necessary or desirable for managing the supply of storm water drainage services; or"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-66-2-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Permission",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Permission to use carriage services for managing supply or charging.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(b) the eligible service is a service that facilitates the supply of a carriage service covered by paragraph (a) of this section."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-151",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "151 Exemption—State or Territory road authorities",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-151"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2012c00870.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.70",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Subsection 143(2) does not apply if:\n\n(a) the eligible service is a carriage service, and the sole use of\nthe carriage service is use by a State or Territory road\nauthority to carry communications necessary or desirable for\nthe management or control of road traffic; or\n\n(b) the eligible service is a service that facilitates the supply of a\ncarriage service covered by paragraph (a) of this section.\n\n(2) Paragraph (1)(a) does not apply to a carriage service supplied to a\nState or Territory road authority unless the carriage service is\nsupplied on the basis that the State or Territory road authority must\nnot re-supply the carriage service.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Subsection 143(2) does not apply if:\n\n(a) the eligible service is a carriage service, and the sole use of\nthe carriage service is use by a State or Territory road\nauthority to carry communications necessary or desirable for\nthe management or control of road traffic; or\n\n(b) the eligible service is a service that facilitates the supply of a\ncarriage service covered by paragraph (a) of this section.\n\n(2) Paragraph (1)(a) does not apply to a carriage service supplied to a\nState or Territory road authority unless the carriage service is\nsupplied on the basis that the State or Territory road authority must\nnot re-supply the carriage service.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-151-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-151-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "027bbc6031d0e6f01d0dcd423894bec4dcc099ea7dfffd87f8a9704f75eedff0"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-151",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "151 Exemption—State or Territory road authorities",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 70,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Subsection 143(2) does not apply if:\n\n(a) the eligible service is a carriage service, and the sole use of\nthe carriage service is use by a State or Territory road\nauthority to carry communications necessary or desirable for\nthe management or control of road traffic; or\n\n(b) the eligible service is a service that facilitates the supply of a\ncarriage service covered by paragraph (a) of this section.\n\n(2) Paragraph (1)(a) does not apply to a carriage service supplied to a\nState or Territory road authority unless the carriage service is\nsupplied on the basis that the State or Territory road authority must\nnot re-supply the carriage service."
    },
