    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-152",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "152 Associate",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-152"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2012c00870.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.70",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, an associate of a person (the\ncontroller) in relation to control of:\n\n(a) a telecommunications network; or\n\n(b) a company;\nis:\n\n(c) a partner of the controller; or\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nAmendments relating to Layer 2 bitstream services  Part 3\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband Network\nMeasures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011          67\n\n(d) if the controller or another person who is an associate of the\ncontroller under another paragraph receives benefits or is\ncapable of benefiting under a trust—the trustee of the trust;\nor\n\n(e) a person (whether a company or not) who:\n\n(i) acts, or is accustomed to act; or\n\n(ii) under a contract or an arrangement or understanding\n(whether formal or informal) is intended or expected to\nact;\n\nin accordance with the directions, instructions or wishes of,\nor in concert with:\n\n(iii) the controller; or\n\n(iv) the controller and another person who is an associate of\nthe controller under another paragraph; or\n\n(f) another company if:\n\n(i) the other company is a related body corporate of the\ncontroller for the purposes of the Corporations Act\n2001; or\n\n(ii) the controller, or the controller and another person who\nis an associate of the controller under another\nparagraph, is or are in a position to exercise control of\nthe other company.\n\n(2) However, persons are not associates of each other if the ACCC is\nsatisfied that:\n\n(a) they do not act together in any relevant dealings relating to\nthe network or company; and\n\n(b) neither of them is in a position to exert influence over the\nbusiness dealings of the other in relation to the network or\ncompany.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, an associate of a person (the\ncontroller) in relation to control of:\n\n(a) a telecommunications network; or\n\n(b) a company;\nis:\n\n(c) a partner of the controller; or\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nAmendments relating to Layer 2 bitstream services  Part 3\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband Network\nMeasures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011          67\n\n(d) if the controller or another person who is an associate of the\ncontroller under another paragraph receives benefits or is\ncapable of benefiting under a trust—the trustee of the trust;\nor\n\n(e) a person (whether a company or not) who:\n\n(i) acts, or is accustomed to act; or\n\n(ii) under a contract or an arrangement or understanding\n(whether formal or informal) is intended or expected to\nact;\n\nin accordance with the directions, instructions or wishes of,\nor in concert with:\n\n(iii) the controller; or\n\n(iv) the controller and another person who is an associate of\nthe controller under another paragraph; or\n\n(f) another company if:\n\n(i) the other company is a related body corporate of the\ncontroller for the purposes of the Corporations Act\n2001; or\n\n(ii) the controller, or the controller and another person who\nis an associate of the controller under another\nparagraph, is or are in a position to exercise control of\nthe other company.\n\n(2) However, persons are not associates of each other if the ACCC is\nsatisfied that:\n\n(a) they do not act together in any relevant dealings relating to\nthe network or company; and\n\n(b) neither of them is in a position to exert influence over the\nbusiness dealings of the other in relation to the network or\ncompany.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-152-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-152-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "451e2523bddc21c018ec3311b3c7f633d389259e837c25a82a2ef8c13c28aaf1"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-152",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "152 Associate",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 70,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, an associate of a person (the\ncontroller) in relation to control of:\n\n(a) a telecommunications network; or\n\n(b) a company;\nis:\n\n(c) a partner of the controller; or\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nAmendments relating to Layer 2 bitstream services  Part 3\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband Network\nMeasures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011          67\n\n(d) if the controller or another person who is an associate of the\ncontroller under another paragraph receives benefits or is\ncapable of benefiting under a trust—the trustee of the trust;\nor\n\n(e) a person (whether a company or not) who:\n\n(i) acts, or is accustomed to act; or\n\n(ii) under a contract or an arrangement or understanding\n(whether formal or informal) is intended or expected to\nact;\n\nin accordance with the directions, instructions or wishes of,\nor in concert with:\n\n(iii) the controller; or\n\n(iv) the controller and another person who is an associate of\nthe controller under another paragraph; or\n\n(f) another company if:\n\n(i) the other company is a related body corporate of the\ncontroller for the purposes of the Corporations Act\n2001; or\n\n(ii) the controller, or the controller and another person who\nis an associate of the controller under another\nparagraph, is or are in a position to exercise control of\nthe other company.\n\n(2) However, persons are not associates of each other if the ACCC is\nsatisfied that:\n\n(a) they do not act together in any relevant dealings relating to\nthe network or company; and\n\n(b) neither of them is in a position to exert influence over the\nbusiness dealings of the other in relation to the network or\ncompany."
    },
