      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.72",
      "values:originalText": "(2) An employee is not, except through an association with another\nperson, to be regarded as being in a position to exercise control of a\nnetwork under subsection (1) purely because of being an employee.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) An employee is not, except through an association with another\nperson, to be regarded as being in a position to exercise control of a\nnetwork under subsection (1) purely because of being an employee.",
      "values:partOf": {
