    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-157",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "157 Certain installations and connections are not taken to be an",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-157"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2012c00870.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.75",
      "values:originalText": "extension, alteration or upgrade\n\nFor the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) a line is or was installed for the purposes of connecting\nparticular premises to a telecommunications network; and\n\n(b) the installation of the line enables or enabled the occupier of\nthe premises to become a customer in relation to carriage\nservices supplied using the network; and\n\n(c) the premises are in close proximity to a line that forms part of\nthe infrastructure of the network; and\n\n(d) the network is capable of being used to supply a superfast\ncarriage service; and\n\n(e) the network came into existence before 1 January 2011;\nneither the installation of the line mentioned in paragraph (a), nor\nthe connection of the premises, is taken to be an extension,\nalteration or upgrade of the network.",
      "skos:definition": "extension, alteration or upgrade\n\nFor the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) a line is or was installed for the purposes of connecting\nparticular premises to a telecommunications network; and\n\n(b) the installation of the line enables or enabled the occupier of\nthe premises to become a customer in relation to carriage\nservices supplied using the network; and\n\n(c) the premises are in close proximity to a line that forms part of\nthe infrastructure of the network; and\n\n(d) the network is capable of being used to supply a superfast\ncarriage service; and\n\n(e) the network came into existence before 1 January 2011;\nneither the installation of the line mentioned in paragraph (a), nor\nthe connection of the premises, is taken to be an extension,\nalteration or upgrade of the network.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-157-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-157-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "055affc44b88b26d5ea6389faf497f9fca504a53a4935497fbfc07cb7970e25a",
      "skos:note": "Installation of a line for connecting premises to a telecommunications network is not considered an extension, alteration or upgrade of the network."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-157",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "157 Certain installations and connections are not taken to be an",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 75,
      "values:originalText": "extension, alteration or upgrade\n\nFor the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) a line is or was installed for the purposes of connecting\nparticular premises to a telecommunications network; and\n\n(b) the installation of the line enables or enabled the occupier of\nthe premises to become a customer in relation to carriage\nservices supplied using the network; and\n\n(c) the premises are in close proximity to a line that forms part of\nthe infrastructure of the network; and\n\n(d) the network is capable of being used to supply a superfast\ncarriage service; and\n\n(e) the network came into existence before 1 January 2011;\nneither the installation of the line mentioned in paragraph (a), nor\nthe connection of the premises, is taken to be an extension,\nalteration or upgrade of the network."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-157-norm",
