      },
      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.76",
      "values:originalText": "For the purposes of this Part, an upgrade of a telecommunications\nnetwork does not include an extension of the network.",
      "skos:definition": "For the purposes of this Part, an upgrade of a telecommunications\nnetwork does not include an extension of the network.",
