    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-93",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "93 After section 152AG",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-93"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2012c00870.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.78",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n152AGA  Designated superfast telecommunications network\n\n(1) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) a telecommunications network is used, or is proposed to be\nused, to supply one or more Layer 2 bitstream services\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nAmendments relating to Layer 2 bitstream services  Part 3\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband Network\nMeasures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011          75\nwholly or principally to residential or small business\ncustomers, or prospective residential or small business\ncustomers, in Australia; and\n\n(b) the network is used, or is proposed to be used, to supply a\nsuperfast carriage service wholly or principally to residential\nor small business customers, or prospective residential or\nsmall business customers, in Australia; and\n\n(c) the network is not the national broadband network; and\n\n(d) either:\n\n(i) the network came into existence on or after 1 January\n2011; or\n\n(ii) the network was altered or upgraded on or after",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n152AGA  Designated superfast telecommunications network\n\n(1) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) a telecommunications network is used, or is proposed to be\nused, to supply one or more Layer 2 bitstream services\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nAmendments relating to Layer 2 bitstream services  Part 3\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband Network\nMeasures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011          75\nwholly or principally to residential or small business\ncustomers, or prospective residential or small business\ncustomers, in Australia; and\n\n(b) the network is used, or is proposed to be used, to supply a\nsuperfast carriage service wholly or principally to residential\nor small business customers, or prospective residential or\nsmall business customers, in Australia; and\n\n(c) the network is not the national broadband network; and\n\n(d) either:\n\n(i) the network came into existence on or after 1 January\n2011; or\n\n(ii) the network was altered or upgraded on or after",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-93-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-93-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "165b3b7b23b9044e7e2d55ea56b82228e89ca7ea4996099776db7c6f1644e326",
      "skos:note": "Telecommunications network must supply Layer 2 bitstream services to residential or small business customers.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-93",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "93 After section 152AG",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 78,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n152AGA  Designated superfast telecommunications network\n\n(1) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\n(a) a telecommunications network is used, or is proposed to be\nused, to supply one or more Layer 2 bitstream services\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nAmendments relating to Layer 2 bitstream services  Part 3\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband Network\nMeasures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011          75\nwholly or principally to residential or small business\ncustomers, or prospective residential or small business\ncustomers, in Australia; and\n\n(b) the network is used, or is proposed to be used, to supply a\nsuperfast carriage service wholly or principally to residential\nor small business customers, or prospective residential or\nsmall business customers, in Australia; and\n\n(c) the network is not the national broadband network; and\n\n(d) either:\n\n(i) the network came into existence on or after 1 January\n2011; or\n\n(ii) the network was altered or upgraded on or after"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-93-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-93"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-93-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Must supply Layer 2 bitstream services.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-1-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "1 January 2011 and, as a result of the alteration or",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-1-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2012c00870.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.79",
      "values:originalText": "upgrade, the network became capable of being used to\nsupply a superfast carriage service to residential or\nsmall business customers, or prospective residential or\nsmall business customers, in Australia;\nthe network is a designated superfast telecommunications\nnetwork.\n\n(2) A network is not a designated superfast telecommunications\nnetwork for the purposes of this Part if, under subsection 141A(1),\nthe network is exempt from section 141.\nNote:\nSection 141 deals with the supply of Layer 2 bitstream services.\nDeemed networks\n\n(3) For the purposes of this section, if:\n\n(a) a telecommunications network is altered or upgraded on or\nafter 1 January 2011; and\n\n(b) as a result of the alteration or upgrade, a part of the network\nbecame capable of being used to supply a superfast carriage\nservice to residential or small business customers, or\nprospective residential or small business customers, in\nAustralia;\nthen:\n\n(c) that part is taken to be a network in its own right; and\n\n(d) the network referred to in paragraph (c) is taken to have come\ninto existence on or after 1 January 2011.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "skos:definition": "upgrade, the network became capable of being used to\nsupply a superfast carriage service to residential or\nsmall business customers, or prospective residential or\nsmall business customers, in Australia;\nthe network is a designated superfast telecommunications\nnetwork.\n\n(2) A network is not a designated superfast telecommunications\nnetwork for the purposes of this Part if, under subsection 141A(1),\nthe network is exempt from section 141.\nNote:\nSection 141 deals with the supply of Layer 2 bitstream services.\nDeemed networks\n\n(3) For the purposes of this section, if:\n\n(a) a telecommunications network is altered or upgraded on or\nafter 1 January 2011; and\n\n(b) as a result of the alteration or upgrade, a part of the network\nbecame capable of being used to supply a superfast carriage\nservice to residential or small business customers, or\nprospective residential or small business customers, in\nAustralia;\nthen:\n\n(c) that part is taken to be a network in its own right; and\n\n(d) the network referred to in paragraph (c) is taken to have come\ninto existence on or after 1 January 2011.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-1-8-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-1-8-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c28fd3e8ea9200cfbfa3dc253d2e9f13eecedc5f515282ff1ba78a2e4bd830c8"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-1-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1 January 2011 and, as a result of the alteration or",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 79,
      "values:originalText": "upgrade, the network became capable of being used to\nsupply a superfast carriage service to residential or\nsmall business customers, or prospective residential or\nsmall business customers, in Australia;\nthe network is a designated superfast telecommunications\nnetwork.\n\n(2) A network is not a designated superfast telecommunications\nnetwork for the purposes of this Part if, under subsection 141A(1),\nthe network is exempt from section 141.\nNote:\nSection 141 deals with the supply of Layer 2 bitstream services.\nDeemed networks\n\n(3) For the purposes of this section, if:\n\n(a) a telecommunications network is altered or upgraded on or\nafter 1 January 2011; and\n\n(b) as a result of the alteration or upgrade, a part of the network\nbecame capable of being used to supply a superfast carriage\nservice to residential or small business customers, or\nprospective residential or small business customers, in\nAustralia;\nthen:\n\n(c) that part is taken to be a network in its own right; and\n\n(d) the network referred to in paragraph (c) is taken to have come\ninto existence on or after 1 January 2011.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-1-8-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "1(2) January 2011 and, as a result of the alteration or",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-1-8-ss-2"
      },
