      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.79",
      "values:originalText": "(2) A network is not a designated superfast telecommunications\nnetwork for the purposes of this Part if, under subsection 141A(1),\nthe network is exempt from section 141.\nNote:\nSection 141 deals with the supply of Layer 2 bitstream services.\nDeemed networks",
      "skos:definition": "(2) A network is not a designated superfast telecommunications\nnetwork for the purposes of this Part if, under subsection 141A(1),\nthe network is exempt from section 141.\nNote:\nSection 141 deals with the supply of Layer 2 bitstream services.\nDeemed networks",
      "values:partOf": {
