    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-1-9-ss-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "1(8) January 2011; and",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-1-9-ss-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2012c00870.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.80",
      "values:originalText": "(8) For the purposes of this section, if:\n\n(a) a line is or was installed for the purposes of connecting\nparticular premises to a telecommunications network; and\n\n(b) the installation of the line enables or enabled the occupier of\nthe premises to become a customer in relation to carriage\nservices supplied using the network; and\n\n(c) the premises are in close proximity to a line that forms part of\nthe infrastructure of the network; and\n\n(d) the network is capable of being used to supply a superfast\ncarriage service; and\n\n(e) the network came into existence before 1 January 2011;\nneither the installation of the line mentioned in paragraph (a), nor\nthe connection of the premises, is taken to be an extension,\nalteration or upgrade of the network.\nSmall business customer",
      "skos:definition": "(8) For the purposes of this section, if:\n\n(a) a line is or was installed for the purposes of connecting\nparticular premises to a telecommunications network; and\n\n(b) the installation of the line enables or enabled the occupier of\nthe premises to become a customer in relation to carriage\nservices supplied using the network; and\n\n(c) the premises are in close proximity to a line that forms part of\nthe infrastructure of the network; and\n\n(d) the network is capable of being used to supply a superfast\ncarriage service; and\n\n(e) the network came into existence before 1 January 2011;\nneither the installation of the line mentioned in paragraph (a), nor\nthe connection of the premises, is taken to be an extension,\nalteration or upgrade of the network.\nSmall business customer",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-1-9"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-1-9-ss-8-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-1-9-ss-8-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "307f7362914f3e42d365f777ad72c6e89b998ef4c16a4f4bb31fd012b9e21b18",
      "skos:note": "Installation of line for telecommunications network purposes is not considered an extension, alteration or upgrade of the network."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-1-9-ss-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1(8) January 2011; and",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 80,
      "values:originalText": "(8) For the purposes of this section, if:\n\n(a) a line is or was installed for the purposes of connecting\nparticular premises to a telecommunications network; and\n\n(b) the installation of the line enables or enabled the occupier of\nthe premises to become a customer in relation to carriage\nservices supplied using the network; and\n\n(c) the premises are in close proximity to a line that forms part of\nthe infrastructure of the network; and\n\n(d) the network is capable of being used to supply a superfast\ncarriage service; and\n\n(e) the network came into existence before 1 January 2011;\nneither the installation of the line mentioned in paragraph (a), nor\nthe connection of the premises, is taken to be an extension,\nalteration or upgrade of the network.\nSmall business customer"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-1-9-ss-8-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
