    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-1-9-ss-9",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "1(9) January 2011; and",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-1-9-ss-9"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2012c00870.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.80",
      "values:originalText": "(9) For the purposes of this section, small business customer means:\n\n(a) a customer who is a small business employer (within the\nmeaning of the Fair Work Act 2009); or\n\n(b) a customer who:\n\n(i) carries on a business; and\n\n(ii) does not have any employees.\nFor the purposes of paragraph (a), it is to be assumed that each\nreference in section 23 of the Fair Work Act 2009 to a national\nsystem employer were a reference to an employer (within the\nordinary meaning of that expression).\nAlteration",
      "skos:definition": "(9) For the purposes of this section, small business customer means:\n\n(a) a customer who is a small business employer (within the\nmeaning of the Fair Work Act 2009); or\n\n(b) a customer who:\n\n(i) carries on a business; and\n\n(ii) does not have any employees.\nFor the purposes of paragraph (a), it is to be assumed that each\nreference in section 23 of the Fair Work Act 2009 to a national\nsystem employer were a reference to an employer (within the\nordinary meaning of that expression).\nAlteration",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-1-9"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-1-9-ss-9-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-1-9-ss-9-logic-descriptionlogic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-1-9-ss-9-logic-deontic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "cc944a1f6b3a5d1967806c3600a155f79126bc0f79d3b8a05bd48a3a52a76518",
      "skos:note": "Defines small business customer for the purposes of this section."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-1-9-ss-9",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1(9) January 2011; and",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 80,
      "values:originalText": "(9) For the purposes of this section, small business customer means:\n\n(a) a customer who is a small business employer (within the\nmeaning of the Fair Work Act 2009); or\n\n(b) a customer who:\n\n(i) carries on a business; and\n\n(ii) does not have any employees.\nFor the purposes of paragraph (a), it is to be assumed that each\nreference in section 23 of the Fair Work Act 2009 to a national\nsystem employer were a reference to an employer (within the\nordinary meaning of that expression).\nAlteration"
    },
