      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "78 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 82,
      "values:originalText": "Network Measures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011\nUpgrade\n\n(11) For the purposes of this section, an upgrade of a\ntelecommunications network does not include an extension of the\nnetwork."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-78-2-norm",
