      },
      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.84",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies to a carrier or carriage service provider if:\n\n(a) a Layer 2 bitstream service is:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nAmendments relating to Layer 2 bitstream services  Part 3\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband Network\nMeasures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011          81\n\n(i) supplied using a designated superfast\ntelecommunications network; and\n\n(ii) a declared service; and\n\n(b) the carrier or provider is subject to a category A standard\naccess obligation in relation to the service.\nNo discrimination",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies to a carrier or carriage service provider if:\n\n(a) a Layer 2 bitstream service is:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nAmendments relating to Layer 2 bitstream services  Part 3\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband Network\nMeasures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011          81\n\n(i) supplied using a designated superfast\ntelecommunications network; and\n\n(ii) a declared service; and\n\n(b) the carrier or provider is subject to a category A standard\naccess obligation in relation to the service.\nNo discrimination",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-80-2"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-80-2-ss-1-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2012c00870-sch-1-sec-80-2-ss-1-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "302546c9393885a0076a311fb658acf314ee59f6499f46b9c236bac3a04459bb",
      "skos:note": "Carrier or carriage service provider must comply with category A standard access obligation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2012c00870#sch-1-sec-80-2-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "80(1) Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 84,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies to a carrier or carriage service provider if:\n\n(a) a Layer 2 bitstream service is:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nAmendments relating to Layer 2 bitstream services  Part 3\n\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (National Broadband Network\nMeasures—Access Arrangements) Act 2011          81\n\n(i) supplied using a designated superfast\ntelecommunications network; and\n\n(ii) a declared service; and\n\n(b) the carrier or provider is subject to a category A standard\naccess obligation in relation to the service.\nNo discrimination"
    },
    {
