      },
      "dc:source": "c2012c00870.pdf, p.87",
      "values:originalText": "(4J) Examples of grounds for believing as mentioned in\nsubsection (4H) include:\n\n(a) evidence that the access seeker is not creditworthy; and\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "skos:definition": "(4J) Examples of grounds for believing as mentioned in\nsubsection (4H) include:\n\n(a) evidence that the access seeker is not creditworthy; and\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00870\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "values:partOf": {
